// 12 curved box edges       → LineSegments, 22 segs/edge, #E2601F
// 3 labelled edge tubes     → TubeGeometry(CatmullRom, r .030) #E2601F, #14A44D when focused
// 2 dashed meridian arcs    → Line + LineDashedMaterial #7A7A7A, radii ρ and ρ+Δρ
// 2 dashed φ rays           → dashed #7A7A7A from origin through both cone faces
// 2 dashed θ rays (xy)      → dashed #7A7A7A through the blue patch
