// @FIGURE_CODE_BEGIN
/* ── ELEMENT SPEC ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// x / y / z axes             → Line + ConeGeometry(0.07,0.24) head, black, length 2.7
// spherical sub-box (place)  → parametric BufferGeometry, 6 faces × 9×9 quads,
//                              MeshBasicMaterial outer #F0A37A / top #F6C4A6 / side #E8895F
// 12 curved box edges        → screen-thickened polylines, #E2601F
// 3 labelled edge tubes      → TubeGeometry(CatmullRom, r .034) #E2601F → #14A44D on focus
// 2 dashed meridian arcs     → thickened dashed polylines #4F4F4F, radii ρ and ρ+Δρ
// 2 dashed φ rays            → thickened dashed #4F4F4F from origin past both cone faces
// 2 dashed θ rays (xy-plane) → thickened dashed #4F4F4F through the blue patch
// 4 dashed drop lines        → light dashed #8A8A8A, φ0-face corners → xy-plane
// blue projection patch      → annular-sector Mesh #2E4B8C + thick outline #142A57
//                              + bracket (2 ticks + arc) beneath its outer edge
// Δρ bracket on z-axis       → 2 horizontal ticks + connector, black
// Δφ arc / Δθ arc            → thickened black arcs r = 1.0 / 0.9 (+ leader)
// ρ sin φ bracket (xy-plane) → segment origin→patch with 2 end ticks, black
// ρΔφ bracket on box         → arc at r1+0.24 with 2 radial ticks, black
// leader arrows              → Line + ConeGeometry head, black
// gray sweep arrow           → TubeGeometry(QuadraticBezier, r .085) + cone head #B3B3B3
// enlarged inset             → same parametric geometry, rotated so outer+side+top show,
//                              ≈2.1× scale, fixed screen offset right of the axes
